initramfs-wifi (1.1) experimental; urgency=medium

  * Include all regular wireless modules and selected staging drivers by
    default.
  * Add support for compressed firmware and older initramfs-tools releases.
  * Add explicit kernel command-line activation and interface detection.
  * Wait for wireless interfaces to appear before starting wpa_supplicant.
  * Work around interrupted BusyBox sleep calls in initramfs scripts.
  * Improve wpa_supplicant shutdown, package scripts, build checks, and
    documentation.

